{"4394140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "One Late Night: Remake", "steam_appid": 4394140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394140/extras/929fa5f8d3983aa5076c8da66d64d594.avif?t=1783285276\" width=430 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work late. Stay alive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Late Night: Remake</strong> brings back the cult indie office-horror classic with modern visuals and controls, expanded story, and new scares — while staying true to the claustrophobic tension that made the original unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an unnamed office worker finishing a late shift when strange events begin to unfold. Lights flicker. Doors lock. Emails corrupt themselves. And somewhere in the building, something is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore a confined office space of corridors, meeting rooms, and abandoned desks, you’ll uncover clues tied to a missing co-worker who tampered with forces unknown — opening a door to an evil entity dressed in a black veil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you dig, the more the office reveals its secrets. This place remembers what was buried beneath it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Haunted Workplace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror in <strong>One Late Night: Remake</strong> is slow, subtle, and psychological. There are no safe spaces — only familiar office environments twisted into something deeply wrong. Every sound, reflection, and flickering screen could be a warning. You want to go home, but something is stopping you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Content, Deeper Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This remake expands on the original game with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New story threads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved gameplay and controls</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Technology as Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with in-office tools, corrupted emails, printers, faxes, and computer systems to solve puzzles and progress. Decoding information isn’t just gameplay — it’s storytelling, and sometimes the system doesn’t want you to read what it remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394140/extras/6493e7307438ab31964f28e797ed703c.poster.avif?t=1783285276\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394140/extras/6493e7307438ab31964f28e797ed703c.webm?t=1783285276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394140/extras/6493e7307438ab31964f28e797ed703c.mp4?t=1783285276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394140/extras/929fa5f8d3983aa5076c8da66d64d594.avif?t=1783285276\" width=430 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work late. Stay alive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Late Night: Remake</strong> brings back the cult indie office-horror classic with modern visuals and controls, expanded story, and new scares — while staying true to the claustrophobic tension that made the original unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an unnamed office worker finishing a late shift when strange events begin to unfold. Lights flicker. Doors lock. Emails corrupt themselves. And somewhere in the building, something is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore a confined office space of corridors, meeting rooms, and abandoned desks, you’ll uncover clues tied to a missing co-worker who tampered with forces unknown — opening a door to an evil entity dressed in a black veil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you dig, the more the office reveals its secrets. This place remembers what was buried beneath it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Haunted Workplace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror in <strong>One Late Night: Remake</strong> is slow, subtle, and psychological. There are no safe spaces — only familiar office environments twisted into something deeply wrong. Every sound, reflection, and flickering screen could be a warning. You want to go home, but something is stopping you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Content, Deeper Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This remake expands on the original game with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New story threads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved gameplay and controls</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Technology as Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with in-office tools, corrupted emails, printers, faxes, and computer systems to solve puzzles and progress. Decoding information isn’t just gameplay — it’s storytelling, and sometimes the system doesn’t want you to read what it remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394140/extras/6493e7307438ab31964f28e797ed703c.poster.avif?t=1783285276\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394140/extras/6493e7307438ab31964f28e797ed703c.webm?t=1783285276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394140/extras/6493e7307438ab31964f28e797ed703c.mp4?t=1783285276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "One Late Night: Remake is a reimagined office horror experience where working late turns into a nightmare. Explore a haunted workplace, solve environmental puzzles, uncover a co-worker’s disappearance, and survive the presence of a dark entity bound to the building’s past.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394140/26a670d13c268e72841931e19b3e0b9e1217cf32/header.jpg?t=1783285276", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394140/728e96d9d4b5d73048eeda19b6b27807f29a4116/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783285276", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394140/728e96d9d4b5d73048eeda19b6b27807f29a4116/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783285276", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 10 series or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</